H - LIST RESIDENT COMMANDS

CALLER. Subject to the current caller access policy.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
H - LIST RESIDENT COMMANDS

CALLER. Subject to the current caller access policy.

Syntax:
    H

Lists commands installed in the CCP, resident command package and flow-
control package. The display depends on the installed packages and current
wheel state.

H is a resident command list, not the full HELPC documentation viewer. Use
HELP COMMANDS for this reference.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
